<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Muthsidi kwa AkwaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 AkwaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Muthsidi kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AkwaTesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa vumenena akwakutawa o mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Yatwe twa Paulu, Silasi na Timoti. Twaa ñorera amwe mwakwa kereke thzo mu Tesalonika, amwe mu di kwa Nyambi Tata wetu noku kwa Fumu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Thsihemo no thsiyaro ikare nenu ku tunderera kwa Nyambi Tata wetu na Fumu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raturo ou a ku keya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Twaa roera ku kanderera kwa Nyambi thsikati thsothsihe mukaci kenu amwe mwaenthzetu. Yaa roera ku tendahara kengeyo, inene thsitawo thsenu thsaa thza o kura nene shemwa, karo no thsishimo ethsi mu cishima thsaa thza o kura. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Mweyo, twaa cishangara keyi yenu mu makereke a Nyambi mukaci ko muooto wenu no thsitawo thsenu mu kunyandithsiwa kwenu no makando yoihe eyi mu cithzua.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ou po ombangi ci raturo thza Nyambi thziwawa, mweyo, kenge mwa ku variwa ci mwaa roera mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi, oku mu nyandera. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Nyambi po muwawa, kenge a ku huthsera makando kowa a mi nyandithsa.<verse eid="2TH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Kenge a ku yooyerithsa amwe mu na nyandithsiwa natwe kengeyo. Kenge a ku tenda kengeyo Fumu Yesu ou a ku hokoriwa ku tunda ku wiru no tungeru twenthzi totukoro, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />mu mirengi thzo mudiro. Kenge a ku pa humbithso awa a na kana ku dimuka Nyambi no kukana ku hengeka Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Fumu wetu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Kenge a ku piwa humbithso thzo kunongithsiwa diyere, karo kenge a ku tundithsiwa pa meho a Fumu no ku tundithsiwa ku kutethzima kwenthzi kokukoro. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Mwedyo diyuwa ou a ku keya ku na tambura kutethzima kwanuenthzi owakenu no ku komokiwa kwakwakutawa wahe, namwe kenge mwa kwikara mu kaciko, inene na mu tawa ombangi ou na tu mi tongwera.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Mweyo, twaa mi rombereranga thsikati thsothsihe. Twaa romba Nyambi wetu ci a mi tende awa na roera mwoyo ou naa mithsera. Kokoro wenthzi a yarithserere eshima yenu yoihe yo ku kwama etenda yoiwa mukaci ko thsitawo thsenu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Twaa rombera kengeyo ci nga dithzina dya Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu di piwe kutethzima mukaci kenu, namwe mu piwe kutethzima mukaci kenthzi. Yoihe eyi yaa twethsa ku tendahara mukaci ko thsihemo thsa Nyambi wetu na Fumu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Shiremeka murao wa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Andengenu, keyi yo kukeya kwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu neyi yo ku kungurweriwa kwetu ku kwenthzi, twaa mi romba, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />mwa ku yapithsiwa wangu nji ku cithzekera yo diyuwa dya Fumu ci di na kumu kare. Mwa ku i tawa shaanga wa ku mi tongwere ci yo na tu kethza, nji ku i amba ko muthzimbu o mu kanwa, nji ci yo na tu ñoro mu diñoro edi a ninga ci dyaa tunda ku kwetu. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mwa tawa munu ku miangera ko dikuñwa dipi nji dipi, inene edyo diyuwa o ku di shime ku keya, anu owangi kenge a ku pirukera Nyambi tango. Karo Shiremeka murao wa Nyambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munu o ku shwahura murao wa Nyambi.</char></note> kenge a ku hokoriwa, oyu na roera ku nongithsiwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kenge a ku reta kunonga. </char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Kenge a ku cithzineka no ku rwithsa yoihe eyi a rombera anu neyi a na remeka yoihe mu dithzina dya Nyambi. Mweyo, kenge a kwingena mu Tembere thza Nyambi no kwikara, no ku cithsa ci yodiyo Nyambi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ene ka mu vurukire ci o ku ni di nenu shime naa mi tongweranga eyi enu nji? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Uno honi mu na dimuka ethsi thsi mu ñaña ci a ku hokoriwe thsikati ethsi thsi na roera. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Okoro o diano dyo ku shwahura murao wa Nyambi u di no ku kwama pano tu di. Oyu na u ñaña kenge a ku twarerera ku tenda kengeyo shime ou a ku tunda mu dikuñwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Munyima thzeyo, Shiremeka murao wa Nyambi mbeci a ku hokoriwe, oyu a kwipaa Fumu [Yesu] ko muñu o mu kanwa kenthzi no ku mu nongithsa ou mba a hokoka o ku keya ko kutethzima kwenthzi.<verse eid="2TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Kukeya koyu Munu Shiremeka murao kenge kwa ku keya kokoro wa Satana. Kenge a ku tenda emonithso yo mishovoshovo nekomokithsa yo mbango. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Karo kenge a ku cikwathsithsa mishovo thzothzihe thzomango kwangera awa a ku cithzira. Kenge a ku cithzira pa kukana ku shima no ku tambura oshemwa ci nga a ku yoyithsiwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Mweyo, Nyambi kenge a ku wa tumena kwangera kokukoro ci nga a tawe yo mbango, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />ci wahe awa na kana ku tawa oshemwa, awo no ku nyanyukera omango a ku raturiwe.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na mu hangweriwa kuyoyithsiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Twaa roera ku kanderera kwa Nyambi thsikati thsothsihe mukaci kenu, andengenu, amwe mu na shimiwa kwa Fumu, inene Nyambi wa mi hangurire ci mwikare mutomwa mu ku yoyithsiwa, ko kukenithsiwa ko Mupepo Oukenu ko ku tawa oshemwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Nyambi yodiyo a mithserire ko Muthzimbu Ouwa ou twa mi rongithsire ci mu twethse ku tambura kutethzima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku eriwa ku kutethzima.</char></note> kwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Mweyo honi, andengenu, mwimane mu tanare, karo mu kwate erongithsa eyi twa mi rongithsire ko maywi o mu kanwa nji o mu diñoro dyetu. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Uno honi, aye shemwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu, na Nyambi Tata wetu oyu wa tu shimine no ku tu pa ko thsihemo thsenthzi kutanarithsiwa ko diyere nokurupero ouwa, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />a mi tanarithse micima no ku mi pa okoro o ku tenda yoiwa yoihe ketenda no maywi.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Mu tu romberere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ko ku manenena, andengenu, mu tu romberere ci diywi dya Fumu di kuwiwe wangu karo di remekiwe eci diya na i na tendahara oko ku kwenu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Mu tu romberere karo ci Nyambi a tu amwene kwanu o kwipa karo owamango, inene kadi cingwa ci anu wahe a na tawa kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Uno honi Fumu wa ku rurama, kenge a ku mi koropithsa no ku mi nyunga koyu o Mumango.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satana. </char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Tu na dimuka shemwa mwa Fumu ci mwaa tenda karo kenge mu twara ku rupara ku tenda eraerera yetu. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Fumu a tware micima thzenu ku thsishimo thsa Nyambi no ku cithzua kwa Krisitu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaa roera ku kwama kadi ku cikarera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Uno honi, andengenu, twaa mi raerera mu dithzina dya Fumu Yesu Krisitu ci mu tunde kwaenthzenu wahe awa a na cikarera, awa a na kana ku hengeka erongithsa eyi mwa tamburire ku kwetu. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Amwe shemwa mu na dimuka omu mu na roera ku tendera ci mu tu temunune, inene atwe ka twekarire nova ou twa nekarire nenu. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Karo ka twa dire edya yo munu ko kukana ku i ura, mweyo, twa kwamine kokoro mutenya nothsiku ci twekara mupango shaanga kwa munu yofoci ku kwenu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Kadi cingwa ka twa roerire ku kwathsiwa ku kwenu eyi twa tenderire kengeyo, unone shime twa tendire kengeyo ku mi pa muro ci mu tu shupwere. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Inene shaanga ou twa nekarire nenu twa mi raerire ci ngeci munu ka a fotire ku kwama ka a roerire ku dya.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Twaa amba kengeyo, inene na tu yuvu ci kwa di anu amweya mu kaci kenu awa a na cikarera, awa a na kana ku fota ku kwama thsimweya shime kwingenangena mwinu yamweya. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Anu o kengeyo, twaa wa raerera no ku wa romba mu dithzina dya Fumu Yesu Krisitu ci a kwame ekwama ko ku tutwara ci a ciyoyithserepo. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Uno honi amwe, andengenu, mwa aya ku tenda owa.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ngeci kwaa di oyu na kana ku hengeka eyi tu amba omu mu diñoro, mu mu dimukere no ku tunda ku kwenthzi ci a ene. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Mwa mu shimba eci mukwathsithzimbo, unone mu mu nomenithse eci muenthzenu mukwakutawa.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena ko mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Aye Fumu shemwa oyu na panga thsiyaro a mi pe thsiyaro thsikati thsothsihe no mu makuñwa oahe. Fumu ekare nenu mwaheno.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ame no Paulu naa ñora ko dyoko dyange ku mi vumenena. Kenge dyo ni na tendanga mu mañoro ange oahe ku monithsa ci aa tunda ku kwange.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Thsihemo thsa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu thsikare nenu mwaheno.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>